          "en": "For that, I'll create a new subfolder, node",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.56,
          "end": 13.843,
          "en": "and a new subfolder, deno.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.7,
          "end": 16.67,
          "en": "And in the node folder,",
